sp {missionaries-and-cannibals*elaborate*operator*after*bank-1*missionary*to
   (state <s> ^problem-space.name missionaries-and-cannibals ^operator <op> + ^world <w>)
   (<op> ^task-operator true ^to <bank> ^move-missionary <m>)
   (<bank> ^object-handle bank-1 ^missionary-count <c>)
